  "id": "urban-ecology",
  "term": "urban ecology",
  "definition": "Urban ecology is the study of ecological patterns and processes in cities as complex systems shaped by both environmental conditions and human social factors. It examines how urban features and social conditions influence living communities and their interactions across urban landscapes.",
